{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act27side_level_act27side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act27side",
  "stageId": "act27side_01",
  "title": "你的耳朵长不长？",
  "storyCode": "SL-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4f5f852b811673a78060496ddb68490e4990409985cda10721053e4f5fbcb218",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是谁在说话......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我啊，是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，总觉得你应该已经习惯我在了，但想起来好像还从来没有这样对你说过话。不对，还是说过来着，唉，我已经忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像是一朵厚重的云从夜空里轻飘飘地落了下来——\n浑身毛绒绒的生物，缓慢旋转着身体，现身在阿黛尔的眼前。\n有一些轻巧，又有一些滑稽地落在了路边的信箱上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你好？晚上好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......小黑羊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你管我叫小黑羊？算了，也行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么这么惊讶？我们也算见过的，应该是见过的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我以为，你......您是不会说话的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "平时是不太会说话的。应该说，只有我会这样讲话，至于那些分身，他们大概是不太愿意和人交流吧。或者是还没有学会？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，也不重要。现在我遇到了你，直接来找你说就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您......知道我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "该怎么说，我也算看着你长大的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不不不，我可没有偷窥别人的习惯。就是一种，简单且单纯的，陪伴。总之，我当然是对你有印象的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道在这里遇见你算不算巧合，但毕竟是个难得的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对不起......我好像有点弄不清状况......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，我能理解，小小的人类总是有问不完的问题——不用着急，我都会回答的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来聊聊吧，现在有时间吗？我不太确定你这个年纪的孩子还用不用赶在某个时间点前回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经不是小孩子了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太好了，那就是说你有时间咯，想不想跟我去散散步？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大水坑、大温泉，还有白白的烟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你画的不对！火山冒出来的是灰色的烟，汐斯塔可不是这个样子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，那边已经不再是汐斯塔了呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们现在待的地方才是汐斯塔，大高楼那边，可都是白色的烟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里是汐斯塔，可是以前的汐斯塔，也还是汐斯塔啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，我知道了，就叫它老汐斯塔吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在的汐斯塔，应该是老汐斯塔的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老汐斯塔就像爸爸一样，虽然现在离我们有点远......但总有一天会回来，还会给我们带礼物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们要什么礼物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "埃尼斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打工结束了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘘——小点声，哈莉已经睡着了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小家伙们，上次我和你们说什么来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要晚上乱跑，不可以去移动城市外的箱子地块......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有不可以在画纸之外的地方乱涂乱画......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我在餐厅后墙上看到的大作《赫尔曼是贝壳脑袋》，是谁画上去的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是大人们都在这么说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......实际上，大人们也不总是对的。所以我们三人的探险队才是有意义的，我们能发现他们发现不了的宝物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是在那之前，明天把墙壁清理干净好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那看在你们承认错误的分上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少年伸出手，三枚精致的小土偶静静躺在手心，小巧精致，脸上的表情栩栩如生，和桌子上摆着的全家福中洋溢着笑容的脸庞一模一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是我们探险小分队新的信物了，一人一个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是从哪来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我自己做的哦，我说过，我会魔法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......不喜欢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（黎博利，菲林，佩洛......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（为什么大家都不一样呢......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实我更想要“D32钢战士”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是说过，贵重的礼物还是要放在更有纪念意义的日子嘛。别着急，想要的东西都在未来等着你呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啦，该回房间去睡觉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "埃尼斯，我们什么时候才能回老汐斯塔呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在还不行哦。如果把它吵醒了，它会大发脾气——喷出很可怕的火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也许过段时间？等它心情好一点，不那么气汹汹的，我再带你们去找它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也想像爸爸一样，成为登山探险家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们比探险家还要厉害，我们有三个人，是个探险队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是探险队！埃尼斯，到时候带我们去挖“黑石头”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎哎哎......不是说好了吗，不要随便说我去挖“黑石头”的事情！要帮我保守秘密啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，可以带我们去老汐斯塔的海滨乐园吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可能到时候，海滨乐园已经变得破破烂烂的了......不过，我可以带你们去找别的游乐园呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别的地方也有水上乐园的，爸爸寄来的照片上不是有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好！火山和水上乐园，我们都要去！埃尼斯要说话算数！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说话算数！这是我们探险队成员之间的约定！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哥伦比亚合作商的货物都装运完毕，然后是莱塔尼亚那边的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还得去确认一下博览会展会场地的分区规划......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "少爷，这么晚了，该休息了。您没必要对所有事情都亲力亲为。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我静不下来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里居民对物流中心建设的态度不算积极，希望通过举办这个跨国商品展览会，能多少改变一点大家的态度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "汐斯塔作为独立城邦，如果能利用好交通枢纽这个属性，城市的发展是大有可为的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您也应该知道，人们很难认识到自己在这样的变化中处在什么样的位置，大家担心的只是未知的新生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我当然能理解。我还记得，小时候跟着父亲从米诺斯搬走的时候，还大哭大闹过一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "生活是有惯性的，接受改变从来都不容易......我也希望，能让大家开心一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听说您今天还约见了诗怀雅小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然没能达成什么共识，但是她的话又提醒了我一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "信使也好，商人也好，当你真的有能力，给别人的生活带来很大的影响的时候，就要认识到这份责任的沉重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "少爷，其实在我看来，您似乎没有必要主动挑起这个担子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爷是对您寄予厚望，但他从来没有要求过您过早地担起这么大的责任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我永远只按他的期望做事，那我永远无法从他的荫蔽下走出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "父亲非常重视在汐斯塔的这个项目。这或许是他离成立峯驰物流最初的理想最近的一次机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且我理解，峯驰物流的根基毕竟在龙门，一举一动都会有商业联合会的桎梏。在汐斯塔子公司这件事上，父亲有他的难处......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爷常常和我说起，离您能完全接手他的工作，大概还有五年时间。在那之前，他可以慢慢准备去雷姆必拓的退休计划了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在看来，他恐怕等不到那个时候就要被您早早取代了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就不要打趣我了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过父亲能早日退休，多去陪陪母亲休养也是好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢你巴特勒，不过不用担心我，趁现在我还有干劲，抓紧把任务做完吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么样？玩得还开心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尝了好多这里的当地美食，还有这里的人工温泉，听说和过去的火山温泉的功效是一模一样的，真的很舒服！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然没有见到传说中的黑曜石音乐节，但是也能感受到这里热情的氛围，玩得很开心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不错嘛，看来新汐斯塔也确实是一个很有商业潜力的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说起来，你今天在外面，有没有感觉到有人在盯着你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盯着我......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别紧张，我就是随便问问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要求一个普通人有反跟踪的意识确实不太合理啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "诗怀雅小姐，这次来到汐斯塔，是带着什么秘密任务吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "任务？什么任务？不是都说了，我就是简简单单来度假的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我和近卫局接触不多，但是听说过一些诗怀雅小姐的故事，也听说过诗怀雅小姐加入近卫局的动机，还有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有您的家族......我大概能够想象，您做出这个决定有多么困难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早知道就不该在面对记者的时候提这件事的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说来说去还是那一回事，真不知道小时候被恐怖分子绑架过有什么好骄傲的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还听说，在陈警司离开后的两年里，近卫局一直都是诗怀雅小姐在把控局面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我不太明白，为什么现在诗怀雅小姐会以家族集团投资人的身份来到汐斯塔呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且......今天跟踪我们的那几个人，好像也是龙门人吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......还真是被问住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雪雉，你觉得，龙门是一个好地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......龙门是我的老家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从当初离开龙门去哥伦比亚求学，再到回到龙门的这几年，这座城市的变化历历在目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "该怎么说呢，看到那些每天都在新起的坚固的高楼大厦，作为一个工程学研究者，还是会感到十分欣慰的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是很坚固，只是有些......太过坚固了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "高楼大厦遮天蔽日，新生的事物就很难获得发展所必要的阳光与养分了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "诗怀雅小姐，您是指......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，就当我胡言乱语吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚才和你说的话，不要和别人提哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "好像是走了很远的一段路。\n庞大的生物在前面默不作声地走着，它慢吞吞地向前挪动。阿黛尔跟在它的后面，时不时揉揉眼睛。\n一步，两步，阿黛尔踩着自己的影子前行，身边的路人对这突然出现的庞然大物却都视若无睹......这真的不是梦吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "孩子，你在看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没、没什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，我们不是散步吗？我们......要去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别着急，就快到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抬头，你看看那边？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一只、两只、三只......路灯下，一只小兽停下脚步，安静地抬起头。\n月光下，毛绒绒的生物们在未建成地块跃动、滚动。\n四只、五只、六只......\n烂漫的灯光中，绒毛像是飞絮，飘散在空中。\n又像是星火，被吹落在这个无人知晓的夏夜。\n七只、八只、九只......\n它们列队整齐，跳过箱子，用蹄印在铁皮上留下涂鸦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些，都是小黑羊吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小黑......不对，大黑羊先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请问......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，还没有自我介绍过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用客气，虽然我比你大很多，但是你可以直接叫我的名字。就叫我多利吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多利先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小时候，我听过的一些童话故事里，都说人快去世的时候，会看到一些奇怪的东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？有这回事吗？真不明白现在那些大人都在给孩子们讲些什么没品味的童话故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心孩子，现在还不到时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近过得怎么样？嗯......或许不该这么问，可怜的孩子，看得出你过得并不太好，至少不是很健康。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但这实在是没什么办法的事......我为你感到惋惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "妈妈说，陪在我身边的这些小羊是她送给我的礼物，是她请求您留在我身边的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多利先生......您认识我的父亲母亲吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些小家伙，解释起来有些复杂。你就当作是我的分身就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过他们每一只都与这个世界有特殊的联系，性格也不太一样。他们愿意跟在你身边，至少说明你是一个受欢迎的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至于你的爸爸妈妈，那当然是认识的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我记得很清楚，来自莱塔尼亚的那对年轻人，孜孜不倦地想要征服世界上的每一座火山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不得不说，就人类而言，想要在世界范围内达成“每一个”的目标，都是愚蠢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是他们的目标是火山，这就不一样了，是非常有品味的理想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很固执，但也很聪明，并且非常有审美！尤其是你的母亲，她是我见过的少有的有智慧的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那他们离去的时候......您也在他们身边吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，这可真是不能轻易提起的沉重话题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还记得，那的确是意料之外的事，没人知道火山会在那时爆发。话说回来，渺小的人类又怎么能真的研究透关于世界的一切呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您也会为他们感到遗憾吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢天谢地，你没有问我“为什么没有救下他们”这样的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然。我很喜欢火山，在沸腾的岩浆里冲浪是这世界上第二快乐的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是火山也夺走了我的两位好朋友的生命，这是近些年来发生的第十一糟糕的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们当然都想要避免一些糟糕的事情发生。但我其实没有看上去那么神通广大，能做到的事也没有那么多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过你要是真的很难过的话，也可以揉一揉我的毛。一般来讲，这样对于缓解坏心情很有用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总之，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一切过去的事都不会真的过去，它们总会换一种方式陪在你的身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "迎面吹来的海风稍有暖意，一人一兽坐在海岸边，静静听着海浪声响。\n毛绒绒的兽群安静地进行着自己的游戏，在集装箱和攀爬架上来回跳跃，时而发出惬意的哼叫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一只小兽努力想要跟着眼前的队伍爬上箱子，但屡屡失败。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形小巧的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（沮丧的叫声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我已经太久没有这样和你们人类坐下来慢慢聊天了。我的语言有点匮乏。所以我还是尽量省去一些客套话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比起那些一眼能看到答案的问题，我更想问你——小家伙，你现在过得开心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我在努力完成爸爸妈妈的研究。虽然很辛苦，但我相信自己现在的生活很有意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也就是说，你现在还是不开心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "难得在汐斯塔碰见你，我们来做一笔交易吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不对，我想想，在你们的语言里，“交易”这个词是这么用的吗？还是说应该用一个亲切一点的词来着......对了，是“游戏”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "简而言之，我想让你帮我找来几样东西，应该是我落在汐斯塔的。算是某种藏宝游戏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果您需要帮助的话......您丢的是什么东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想想。是北风，种子，皮毛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这......都是什么啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提前揭晓谜底哪还能算是游戏呢？不要急于追问答案，要多去感受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，不会白白辛苦你的。等你把这几样东西找齐的时候，我也会给你相应的报酬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......就是你一直在找的东西，怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要找的东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以就是这样，北风，种子，皮毛，就有劳你帮我找齐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
